# Test Tagging Standards

> **Purpose**: Defines test tagging requirements, categories, and generation rules.
> Ensures consistent tag application across all test scenarios.

## 📋 Metadata
- **ID**: `tagging_standards`
- **Name**: Test Tagging Standards
- **Type**: Tagging Guidelines
- **Scope**: Test generation and execution

---

## 🎯 Tagging System Overview

### **Architecture**
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  TagConfiguration.json (tests/Settings/)                        │
│  Purpose: Define tag categories, values, validation rules       │
└───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  TestTagsMapping.json (tests/Utils/)                            │
│  Purpose: Map testId → tags (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH)            │
│  Key: testId format TC_XXX_vYYY_Name (IMMUTABLE)                │
└───────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  TagHelper.taggedTest() (Engine/Shared/TagHelper.ts)            │
│  Purpose: Load and apply tags at runtime                        │
│  Rule: ONLY way to define tests with tags                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

