## 📊 Tag Categories

### Complete Tag Taxonomy

| Category | Type | Values | Mandatory | Allow Multiple |
|----------|------|--------|-----------|----------------|
| **suite** | Fixed | `smoke`, `regression`, `full`, `sanity` | ✅ Yes | ✅ Yes |
| **priority** | Fixed | `critical`, `high`, `medium`, `low` | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **type** | Fixed | `e2e`, `api`, `integration`, `ui`, `unit` | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **dataImpact** | Fixed | `readonly`, `mutating` | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |
| **environment** | Fixed | `dev`, `staging`, `production`, `all` | ❌ No | ✅ Yes |
| **stability** | Fixed | `stable`, `flaky`, `wip`, `deprecated` | ❌ No | ❌ No |
| **speed** | Fixed | `fast`, `medium`, `slow` | ❌ No | ❌ No |
| **feature** | Extensible | *Defined during generation* | ❌ No | ✅ Yes |
| **component** | Extensible | *Defined during generation* | ❌ No | ✅ Yes |
| **team** | Extensible | *Defined during generation* | ❌ No | ❌ No |

