## 🔖 TestId Format

### Format: `TC_XXX_vYYY_DescriptiveName`

| Part | Description | Example |
|------|-------------|---------|
| `TC_` | Prefix (Test Case) | `TC_` |
| `XXX` | Sequential number (3 digits, zero-padded) | `001`, `042`, `123` |
| `_v` | Version separator | `_v` |
| `YYY` | Version number (3 digits, default `001`) | `001`, `002` |
| `_` | Separator | `_` |
| `DescriptiveName` | PascalCase descriptive name | `CreateSchoolWithMandatoryFields` |

### Examples:
- `TC_001_v001_CreateSchoolWithMandatoryFields`
- `TC_002_v001_AddSubjectAndLinkTeacher`
- `TC_001_v002_CreateSchoolWithMandatoryFields` *(explicit new version)*

### TestId Rules:
- **(MANDATORY)** Default version is always `001`
- **(MANDATORY)** New version created ONLY when user explicitly requests
- **(MANDATORY)** TestId is IMMUTABLE once generated
- **(MANDATORY)** Sequential number determined from existing TestTagsMapping.json
- **(MANDATORY)** DescriptiveName must be PascalCase, start with letter

