## 🚫 Prohibited Patterns

### ❌ Manual Tag Annotations

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG - Manual tag annotations not allowed
test('Create school @smoke @critical', async ({ page }) => {
  // ...
});

// ❌ WRONG - Manual tag option not allowed
test('Create school', {
  tag: ['@smoke', '@critical'],
}, async ({ page }) => {
  // ...
});
```

### ❌ Hardcoded Tags in Test Files

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG - Tags hardcoded in test file
const tags = ['@smoke', '@critical', '@e2e'];
```

### ✅ Correct Pattern

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Tags loaded from TestTagsMapping.json via TagHelper
const TEST_ID = 'TC_001_v001_CreateSchoolWithMandatoryFields';

TagHelper.taggedTest(TEST_ID, async ({ page }) => {
  // ...
});
```

