## ⚙️ Execution Filtering

### By Tag (CLI)

```bash
# Run smoke tests
npx playwright test --grep "@smoke"

# Run critical priority tests
npx playwright test --grep "@critical"

# Run by feature
npx playwright test --grep "@feature:school-management"

# Exclude flaky tests
npx playwright test --grep-invert "@flaky"

# Combine filters
npx playwright test --grep "@smoke" --grep-invert "@slow"

# Run readonly tests only
npx playwright test --grep "@readonly"

# Run mutating tests only
npx playwright test --grep "@mutating"
```

