## ✅ Tagging Checklist (For Generation)

### Before Generating Test

- [ ] Determined next sequential testId number from TestTagsMapping.json
- [ ] Created PascalCase descriptive name for testId
- [ ] Using version `001` (unless explicit new version requested)

### Tag Assignment

- [ ] **suite**: Assigned (mandatory)
- [ ] **priority**: Assigned (mandatory)
- [ ] **type**: Assigned (mandatory)
- [ ] **dataImpact**: Assigned (mandatory) - `readonly` or `mutating`
- [ ] Optional tags assigned as appropriate

### Extensible Tags

- [ ] Checked existing feature values before adding new
- [ ] Checked existing component values before adding new
- [ ] Checked existing team values before adding new
- [ ] Added new values only if semantically different

### Test Description

- [ ] Description is comprehensive (not short/vague)
- [ ] Description explains test purpose clearly
- [ ] Description is sufficient to understand intent

### File Updates

- [ ] TestTagsMapping.json updated with new entry
- [ ] TagConfiguration.json updated if new extensible values
- [ ] Test file uses TagHelper.taggedTest() wrapper
- [ ] Test file contains testId constant only (no manual tags)

