## 🎯 Success Criteria

- ✅ **Mandatory Tags**: All 4 mandatory tags assigned
- ✅ **Valid Values**: All tag values are valid per configuration
- ✅ **Extensible Reuse**: Existing values reused when semantically matching
- ✅ **Comprehensive Description**: Test description is clear and complete
- ✅ **Immutable TestId**: TestId never changes after generation
- ✅ **No Manual Tags**: Zero manual tag annotations in test files
- ✅ **Single Source**: All tags from TestTagsMapping.json only